# Proft, Sinister Mastermind: "Threshold - You can't cast this spell unless there are seven or more cards in your graveyard."
# On turn 1 Bot1's graveyard gets six cards: Town Greeter mills four, then a Lotus Petal (sacrificed for {B}) and a Dark
# Ritual cast with it go there. On turn 3 Proft is drawn and, with six cards in the graveyard, is refused. The second Dark
# Ritual is cast, resolves and is the seventh card; its {B}{B}{B} then pays for Proft, which is now allowed and resolves
# (positive control: the same card, the same mana, only the count changed).

